    "detailed_description": "<h1>Flashlight</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/acbd8b58262aab0c236ca20e4ea12c6c.poster.avif?t=1754314252\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/acbd8b58262aab0c236ca20e4ea12c6c.webm?t=1754314252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/acbd8b58262aab0c236ca20e4ea12c6c.mp4?t=1754314252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The Flashlight is the first and most important tool in your backpack.  Though, this flashlight doesn't just light up the dark.  It shines its way to <i>somewhere else.</i>  Use it to solve puzzles and explore a dilapidated facility that has been long abandoned.</p><br><h1>Lantern</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/1d1f02d1387e74910b62ab134c24edfa.poster.avif?t=1754314252\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/1d1f02d1387e74910b62ab134c24edfa.webm?t=1754314252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/1d1f02d1387e74910b62ab134c24edfa.mp4?t=1754314252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The second tool at your disposal is The Lantern.  Endowed with the same power as The Flashlight, these lanterns provide the ability to punch holes between here and <i>somewhere else.</i>  But what are they doing here?  And who left them?</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Beginning as a submission to the 2023 Big Mode Game Jam, Backpack Boy, a puzzle-platformer built around using special light sources to affect the world around you has been expanded to a full game with new levels and new mechanics.<br><br>This short experience is packed full of fun and interesting puzzles.<br><br>Explore deeper to uncover the mysteries at the heart of the facility.  <br><br>Something is waiting for you...",
    "about_the_game": "Beginning as a submission to the 2023 Big Mode Game Jam, Backpack Boy, a puzzle-platformer built around using special light sources to affect the world around you has been expanded to a full game with new levels and new mechanics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis short experience is packed full of fun and interesting puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore deeper to uncover the mysteries at the heart of the facility.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSomething is waiting for you...",
    "short_description": "Backpack Boy is off on one of his treks when he discovers a peculiar flashlight that changes the world around him. Explore a seemingly abandoned structure in this puzzle platformer built around mode-swapping.",
